<body>

<div class="cover">
  <h1>CT Jobportal</h1>
  <p style="font-size:20pt; margin-top:-10px;">Manual Test Case Document</p>
  <p>End-to-End Functional Test Cases &mdash; All Modules &amp; Roles</p>
  <table class="meta-table">
    <tr><td><b>Document Version</b></td><td>1.0</td></tr>
    <tr><td><b>Date</b></td><td>27-Jul-2026</td></tr>
    <tr><td><b>Application</b></td><td>CT Jobportal (React/Vite + Node/Express/MongoDB, Socket.IO, Razorpay, Jitsi)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><b>Prepared For</b></td><td>QA / Engineering Team</td></tr>
    <tr><td><b>Status</b></td><td>Draft for Execution</td></tr>
  </table>
</div>

<h1>1. Introduction</h1>

<h3>1.1 Purpose</h3>
<p>This document provides a complete set of manual functional test cases covering every module and user role of the CT Jobportal application, from account creation through subscription/payment, job posting, applications, campus placements, messaging, tickets, and admin governance. It is intended to be executed end-to-end before each major release and re-run (regression) after significant changes to any module.</p>

<h3>1.2 Scope</h3>
<p>In scope: all pages under <code>client/src/pages</code> (Auth, Admin, Sub-admin, College, Company/Recruiter, Org Employee, Job Seeker, Public, Shared, Tickets) and their corresponding backend flows (auth, jobs, applications, subscriptions, payments, pay-per-feature, college/drives, messaging, tickets, reviews, assessments, interviews, WhatsApp/email notifications).</p>
<p>Out of scope: automated unit/integration tests, load/stress testing, and third-party service internals (Razorpay, Jitsi, Gemini, Meta WhatsApp Cloud API) beyond verifying the integration points.</p>

<h3>1.3 Roles Covered</h3>
<p>
<span class="role-tag">jobseeker</span>
<span class="role-tag">recruiter</span>
<span class="role-tag">company</span>
<span class="role-tag">org_employee</span>
<span class="role-tag">college</span>
<span class="role-tag">drive_incharge</span>
<span class="role-tag">admin</span>
<span class="role-tag">sub-admin</span>
<span class="role-tag">public / guest</span>
</p>

<h3>1.4 Test Environment</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Frontend: React + Vite (client/), Backend: Node.js + Express + MongoDB (server/)</li>
  <li>Real-time chat: Socket.IO | Payments: Razorpay (one-time orders + recurring subscriptions) | Video: Jitsi Meet SDK</li>
  <li>Notifications: Email (SMTP) + WhatsApp (Meta Cloud API templates)</li>
  <li>Browsers: Chrome, Edge, Firefox (latest) | Devices: Desktop 1920x1080, Laptop 1366x768, Tablet 768px, Mobile 390px</li>
  <li>Test data: at least 2 seeded accounts per role, 1 admin, 1 sub-admin, expired/near-expiry subscriptions, a blocked user, a pending college verification</li>
</ul>

<h3>1.5 Test Case ID Convention</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th>Prefix</th><th>Module</th><th>Prefix</th><th>Module</th></tr>
<tr><td>AUTH</td><td>Authentication &amp; Onboarding</td><td>EMP</td><td>Org Employee</td></tr>
<tr><td>ADM</td><td>Admin</td><td>JS</td><td>Job Seeker Core</td></tr>
<tr><td>SUB-A</td><td>Sub-admin</td><td>JSF</td><td>Job Seeker Premium Features</td></tr>
<tr><td>COL</td><td>College</td><td>PUB</td><td>Public Pages</td></tr>
<tr><td>CMP</td><td>Company / Recruiter Core</td><td>SHR</td><td>Shared Modules</td></tr>
<tr><td>CMPF</td><td>Company Premium Features</td><td>TCK</td><td>Tickets &amp; Support</td></tr>
<tr><td>SUBS</td><td>Subscription &amp; Payment</td><td>NFR</td><td>Non-Functional / Cross-cutting</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>1.6 Priority Legend</h3>
<p><span class="p1">P1 - Critical</span> (blocks core business flow, must pass before release) &nbsp;|&nbsp;
<span class="p2">P2 - High</span> (important feature/validation) &nbsp;|&nbsp;
<span class="p3">P3 - Medium</span> (edge case / secondary UX)</p>

<div class="note"><b>Format used below:</b> TC ID | Test Scenario | Steps | Expected Result | Priority. Each case assumes the previous section's preconditions (e.g. a logged-in user of the relevant role) unless steps state otherwise.</div>

<h2 id="auth">2. Authentication &amp; Onboarding</h2>
<p>Pages: Register.jsx, Login.jsx, VerifyOtp.jsx, ForgotPassword.jsx, CompanyLogin.jsx, CompleteSocialProfile.jsx, SocialAuthSuccess.jsx</p>

<h3>2.1 Registration</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-001</td><td>Register as Job Seeker with valid data</td><td>Go to Register &rarr; select role "jobseeker" &rarr; fill name, email, password (e.g. Pass@123), confirm password &rarr; Submit</td><td>Account created, redirected to OTP verification screen, OTP email sent</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-002</td><td>Register as Recruiter with valid data</td><td>Select role "recruiter" &rarr; fill required fields &rarr; Submit</td><td>Account created, OTP screen shown</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-003</td><td>Register as Company with valid data</td><td>Select role "company" &rarr; fill required fields &rarr; Submit</td><td>Account created, OTP screen shown</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-004</td><td>Register as College with valid data</td><td>Select role "college" &rarr; fill name/email/password + collegeName, collegeEmail, collegePhone, tpoPhone &rarr; Submit</td><td>Account created, pending verification state, OTP screen shown</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-005</td><td>College registration missing tpoPhone</td><td>Fill all college fields except tpoPhone &rarr; Submit</td><td>Client-side validation error, form not submitted</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-006</td><td>Password fails complexity rule</td><td>Enter password "abcdefg" (no uppercase/number/symbol) &rarr; Submit</td><td>Inline validation error; submit blocked</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-007</td><td>Confirm password mismatch</td><td>Password "Pass@123", Confirm "Pass@124" &rarr; Submit</td><td>"Passwords do not match" error shown</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-008</td><td>Register with already-registered email</td><td>Use an email that already has an account &rarr; Submit</td><td>Server returns duplicate-email error; no new account created</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-009</td><td>Register with invalid email format</td><td>Enter "abc@" as email &rarr; Submit</td><td>Zod validation error shown, submit blocked</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-010</td><td>Switch role toggle clears role-specific fields</td><td>Fill college-specific fields &rarr; switch role to jobseeker</td><td>College-only fields hidden/cleared; no leftover data submitted</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>2.2 OTP Verification</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-011</td><td>Verify with correct 6-digit OTP</td><td>Enter the OTP received by email &rarr; Submit</td><td>Account verified/activated; user redirected to login or auto-logged-in to role dashboard</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-012</td><td>Verify with incorrect OTP</td><td>Enter a wrong 6-digit code &rarr; Submit</td><td>Error message shown; account remains unverified</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-013</td><td>Resend OTP before cooldown expires</td><td>Immediately click Resend within 60s</td><td>Resend button disabled, countdown timer visible, no new email sent</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-014</td><td>Resend OTP after cooldown</td><td>Wait 60s &rarr; click Resend</td><td>New OTP emailed, old OTP invalidated, timer resets</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-015</td><td>Edit email on standalone VerifyOtp page</td><td>Navigate directly to Verify OTP page &rarr; change email &rarr; request OTP</td><td>OTP sent to newly entered email address</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-016</td><td>Expired OTP submitted</td><td>Wait beyond OTP validity window &rarr; enter old OTP</td><td>"OTP expired" error, must resend</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>2.3 Login &amp; Forgot Password</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-017</td><td>Login with valid credentials, correct role selected</td><td>Select matching role toggle &rarr; enter email/password &rarr; "Authorize Access"</td><td>Redirected to the correct role dashboard</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-018</td><td>Login with correct credentials but wrong role toggle</td><td>Login as a jobseeker account while "recruiter" toggle selected</td><td>Error: role mismatch / account not found for that role; login denied</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-019</td><td>Login with wrong password</td><td>Correct email, incorrect password &rarr; Submit</td><td>Generic invalid-credentials error, no account lockout info leaked</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-020</td><td>Login to a blocked account</td><td>Login using credentials of a user with isAdminBlocked=true</td><td>Access denied with "account blocked" message</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-021</td><td>Company Login dedicated page</td><td>Navigate to /company-login &rarr; enter valid company credentials &rarr; "Enter Business Portal"</td><td>Redirected to Company Dashboard</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-022</td><td>Forgot password - request OTP</td><td>Forgot Password &rarr; enter registered email &rarr; Submit</td><td>Step advances to OTP+new-password screen; OTP emailed</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-023</td><td>Forgot password - reset with valid OTP</td><td>Enter OTP + new password &rarr; Submit</td><td>Success screen shown; login works with new password; old password rejected</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-024</td><td>Forgot password - invalid/expired OTP</td><td>Enter wrong OTP on reset step</td><td>Error shown, password not changed</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>2.4 Social Login</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-025</td><td>Sign up via Google/GitHub/LinkedIn - new user</td><td>Click a social button on Register/Login &rarr; complete provider OAuth consent</td><td>Redirected to SocialAuthSuccess &rarr; then CompleteSocialProfile (role picker + password)</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-026</td><td>Complete social profile - valid data</td><td>Pick role (jobseeker/recruiter/company) &rarr; set password + confirm &rarr; Submit</td><td>Profile completed, redirected to correct role dashboard</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-027</td><td>Complete social profile - password mismatch</td><td>Password and Confirm differ &rarr; Submit</td><td>"Passwords do not match" error</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">AUTH-028</td><td>Social login - existing complete profile</td><td>Log in via social provider for an account that already finished onboarding</td><td>Skips CompleteSocialProfile, goes directly to role dashboard</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 id="admin">3. Admin Module</h2>
<p>Pages: Dashboard, ManageUsers, ManageCompanies, ManageBuyers/BuyerDetails, ManageJobs, ManageSubscriptions, ManagePayPer, ManageRenewals, ManageRefunds, ManageRequests, ManageReviews, CollegeVerification, PaymentHistory, AdminSettings, AdminTickets.</p>

<h3>3.1 Dashboard</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-001</td><td>Dashboard loads platform KPIs</td><td>Login as admin &rarr; land on Dashboard</td><td>Totals (users, companies, colleges, revenue, active subscriptions) match DB counts</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-002</td><td>Non-admin cannot access admin routes</td><td>Login as jobseeker/company &rarr; navigate directly to /admin/dashboard URL</td><td>Redirected away / 403, admin UI not rendered</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>3.2 Manage Users / Companies</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-003</td><td>Filter users by role tab</td><td>ManageUsers &rarr; click jobseeker / recruiter / company / college tabs</td><td>List filters correctly per tab</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-004</td><td>Block a user</td><td>Select active user &rarr; Block</td><td>isAdminBlocked=true; user can no longer log in (see AUTH-020)</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-005</td><td>Unblock a user</td><td>Select blocked user &rarr; Unblock</td><td>User can log in again</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-006</td><td>Edit a user's role</td><td>Open user &rarr; change role &rarr; Save</td><td>Role updated; user's route/dashboard access changes accordingly on next login</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-007</td><td>Delete a user</td><td>Select user &rarr; Delete &rarr; confirm</td><td>User removed from list and DB; related data handled per cascade rules</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-008</td><td>Message a user from admin panel</td><td>Click Message icon on a user row</td><td>Chat thread opens/creates with that user</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-009</td><td>View/edit a company's profile and verification badge</td><td>ManageCompanies &rarr; open a company &rarr; check is_verified badge</td><td>Verified/Pending badge accurate; edits persist</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-010</td><td>Delete a company</td><td>Select company &rarr; Delete &rarr; confirm</td><td>Company and its postings removed/deactivated appropriately</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-011</td><td>View Buyer Details</td><td>ManageBuyers &rarr; open BuyerDetails for a paying user</td><td>Correct purchase/subscription history displayed for that buyer</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>3.3 Manage Jobs / Reviews / Requests</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-012</td><td>Moderate/remove an inappropriate job posting</td><td>ManageJobs &rarr; open job &rarr; deactivate/delete</td><td>Job no longer visible to job seekers</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-013</td><td>Approve a pending review</td><td>ManageReviews &rarr; open pending review &rarr; Approve</td><td>Status &rarr; approved; review appears on public Home page</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-014</td><td>Reject a review</td><td>ManageReviews &rarr; Reject a pending review</td><td>Status &rarr; rejected; not shown publicly</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-015</td><td>Assign a counselling/mock-interview/website request</td><td>ManageRequests &rarr; open request (type counselling|mock_interview|website_request) &rarr; Assign to recruiter/company</td><td>Status pending &rarr; approved; assignee notified</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-016</td><td>Update request status to completed with notes</td><td>Open an approved request &rarr; add notes &rarr; mark completed</td><td>Status updates to completed; notes saved and visible to requester</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-017</td><td>Cancel a request</td><td>Open pending request &rarr; Cancel</td><td>Status &rarr; cancelled; requester notified</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>3.4 Subscriptions, Pay-Per-Feature, Renewals, Refunds</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-018</td><td>Create/edit a subscription plan</td><td>ManageSubscriptions &rarr; create plan with price/duration (Monthly/Quarterly/Yearly/Lifetime) &rarr; Save</td><td>Plan appears in respective role's Subscription page pricing</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-019</td><td>Deactivate a subscription plan</td><td>Toggle a plan inactive</td><td>Plan no longer purchasable by new users; existing subscribers unaffected</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-020</td><td>Create a pay-per-feature item</td><td>ManagePayPer &rarr; add featureKey, cost, days, usageCount &rarr; Save</td><td>Feature appears on PayPerFeatures page with correct price/usage</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-021</td><td>Filter renewals by expiring_soon</td><td>ManageRenewals &rarr; filter = expiring_soon</td><td>Only subscriptions within the expiry window shown</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-022</td><td>Extend a user's subscription</td><td>Select user &rarr; Extend &rarr; enter days &rarr; confirm</td><td>PATCH /admin/users/:id/extend-subscription succeeds; new expiry date reflected on user's Subscription page</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-023</td><td>Bulk send renewal reminder</td><td>Select multiple expiring users &rarr; Send Reminder</td><td>Reminder email/WhatsApp (renewal_reminder template) sent to all selected</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-024</td><td>Approve a refund request</td><td>ManageRefunds &rarr; filter refund_pending &rarr; Approve</td><td>Payment status &rarr; refunded; user's subscription reverted to Free plan</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-025</td><td>Reject a refund request</td><td>ManageRefunds &rarr; Reject a refund_pending item</td><td>Status reverts to completed; user's paid plan remains active</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>3.5 College Verification, Payment History, Settings, Tickets</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-026</td><td>Verify a pending college</td><td>CollegeVerification &rarr; open pending college &rarr; Verify</td><td>verificationStatus &rarr; verified; college gains full portal access</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-027</td><td>Reject a college verification</td><td>Open pending college &rarr; Reject with reason</td><td>verificationStatus &rarr; rejected; college notified with reason</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-028</td><td>Reset a college's verification status</td><td>Open verified/rejected college &rarr; Reset</td><td>Status returns to pending for re-review</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">ADM-029</td><td>View global payment history</td><td>PaymentHistory &rarr; filter by status/date</td><td>Accurate list of all completed/failed/refunded transactions platform-wide</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
