<tr><td class="col-id">JS-001</td><td>Dashboard shows recommended jobs and quick stats</td><td>Login as jobseeker &rarr; view Dashboard</td><td>Relevant open jobs and application/profile stats displayed</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
