<tr><td class="col-id">JS-003</td><td>Apply to a job missing a required custom question</td><td>Leave a required custom question blank &rarr; Submit</td><td>Validation error, application not submitted</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-004</td><td>View MyApplications and track status</td><td>MyApplications &rarr; view list</td><td>Statuses shown as friendly labels: Pending Review/Reviewed/Shortlisted/Not Selected/Offer Extended/Withdrawn</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-005</td><td>Withdraw an application while pending/reviewed</td><td>Select a pending or reviewed application &rarr; Withdraw</td><td>Status &rarr; withdrawn successfully</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-006</td><td>Withdraw an application already shortlisted/rejected/accepted</td><td>Attempt Withdraw on a shortlisted/rejected/accepted application</td><td>Blocked with 400 "cannot be revoked" error</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-007</td><td>Save a job for later</td><td>Job listing &rarr; click Save/bookmark icon</td><td>Job appears under SavedJobs</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-008</td><td>Remove a saved job</td><td>SavedJobs &rarr; Unsave a job</td><td>Job removed from saved list</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-009</td><td>Register for a campus drive</td><td>CampusDrives &rarr; open an eligible active drive &rarr; register</td><td>Registration recorded, matches college-side stage tracking (see COL-022)</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-010</td><td>Attempt to register for drive when ineligible (CGPA/backlog)</td><td>Register on a drive with minCGPA/maxArrears criteria not met</td><td>Blocked or flagged ineligible</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-011</td><td>View own Public Profile as seen by recruiters</td><td>Open PublicProfile preview</td><td>Displays only intended public fields; matches recruiter-side CandidateSearch view</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-012</td><td>Update profile Settings (resume upload, personal info)</td><td>Settings &rarr; upload resume, edit skills/experience &rarr; Save</td><td>Profile updates persist; new resume used in subsequent applications</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-013</td><td>Message a recruiter within plan's cap</td><td>Contact a recruiter via chat while under messageRecruitersCount limit</td><td>Message sent successfully; count decremented</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JS-014</td><td>Exceed recruiter-messaging cap for plan</td><td>Attempt to message a new recruiter after cap reached</td><td>Blocked with upgrade prompt</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 id="jsfeatures">10. Job Seeker Premium Features</h2>
<p>Pages: AiResumeReview, CareerCounselling, JobAlerts, MockInterviews, ProfileInsights, ResumeBuilder, SalaryBenchmarking, SkillTests, AIGenerateModal.</p>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-001</td><td>Access premium feature on Free plan</td><td>Open any premium feature page without entitlement</td><td>Locked state with Upgrade/Buy Now CTA</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-002</td><td>AI Resume Review generates feedback</td><td>Upload/select resume &rarr; run AI Resume Review</td><td>Structured feedback (strengths/gaps/suggestions) returned</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-003</td><td>Request Career Counselling session</td><td>CareerCounselling &rarr; submit request form</td><td>Request created status=pending; visible to admin in ManageRequests (type=counselling)</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-004</td><td>Career Counselling request approved by admin</td><td>Admin approves the request (see ADM-015)</td><td>Job seeker sees status update to approved with assigned counsellor</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-005</td><td>Create a Job Alert</td><td>JobAlerts &rarr; set keyword/location/salary criteria &rarr; Save</td><td>Alert saved; matching new jobs trigger a notification</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-006</td><td>Delete a Job Alert</td><td>JobAlerts &rarr; remove an existing alert</td><td>Alert deleted, no further notifications for it</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-007</td><td>Request a Mock Interview</td><td>MockInterviews &rarr; submit skills + careerGoal &rarr; Submit request</td><td>Request created status=pending; admin/professional can approve/assign (see ADM-015)</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-008</td><td>Mock interview marked completed</td><td>After session, admin marks request completed</td><td>Job seeker sees status=completed with any feedback notes</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-009</td><td>View Profile Insights</td><td>Open ProfileInsights</td><td>Profile completeness score and improvement suggestions shown</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-010</td><td>Build a resume with Resume Builder</td><td>ResumeBuilder &rarr; fill sections (experience/education/skills) &rarr; Generate/Save</td><td>Resume generated/downloadable in expected format</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-011</td><td>View Salary Benchmarking for a role</td><td>SalaryBenchmarking &rarr; enter role/location &rarr; view results</td><td>Reasonable salary range/data displayed for the query</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-012</td><td>Take a Skill Test and pass</td><td>SkillTests &rarr; start AI-generated 10-question MCQ (skill+difficulty) &rarr; answer &ge;70% correctly &rarr; Submit</td><td>Result shows Pass; badge/credential awarded</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-013</td><td>Take a Skill Test and fail (&lt;70%)</td><td>Answer below 70% correctly &rarr; Submit</td><td>Result shows Fail; retake option offered per policy</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-014</td><td>Skill test question caching</td><td>Retake the same skill+difficulty test shortly after</td><td>Cached question set served (from Mongo cache) rather than a fresh Gemini call each time</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">JSF-015</td><td>Use AI Generate Modal (e.g. AI-assisted content generation)</td><td>Trigger AIGenerateModal from a relevant feature &rarr; enter prompt/context &rarr; Generate</td><td>AI-generated content returned and insertable into the target field</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 id="public">11. Public Pages (Guest / Unauthenticated)</h2>
<p>Pages: Home, public/CampusRegistration, CompanyDriveView, FreeAssessment, AcceptInchargeInvite, PrincipalExecutiveSummary.</p>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">PUB-001</td><td>Home page loads for a guest</td><td>Visit site root without logging in</td><td>Homepage renders with job search, approved reviews, CTA to Register/Login</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">PUB-002</td><td>Only approved reviews show on Home</td><td>Compare Home page reviews to ManageReviews data</td><td>Only status=approved reviews are publicly visible</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">PUB-003</td><td>Guest browses/searches public job listings</td><td>Use search/filter on Home or jobs listing</td><td>Active jobs returned matching filters; draft/closed jobs excluded</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">PUB-004</td><td>Guest attempts to apply to a job</td><td>Click Apply on a job while logged out</td><td>Redirected to Login/Register before application form</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">PUB-005</td><td>View a Company Drive publicly</td><td>Open a shared CompanyDriveView link</td><td>Drive details (companies, eligibility, rounds) visible without login</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">PUB-006</td><td>Take a Free Assessment</td><td>Open FreeAssessment &rarr; complete sample quiz</td><td>Score/result shown; prompts sign-up for full features</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">PUB-007</td><td>View Principal Executive Summary report</td><td>Open PrincipalExecutiveSummary link (typically shared with college principal)</td><td>High-level placement stats rendered correctly for the college/time range</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">PUB-008</td><td>Campus registration public flow</td><td>Same as COL-022 from a guest's perspective</td><td>Works without requiring prior portal login</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
