<h2 id="shared">12. Shared Modules: Drives, Pay-Per-Feature, Payment History, Reviews</h2>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SHR-001</td><td>ManageDrive shared component - shared between college/company views</td><td>Open a drive as college vs. as an invited company</td><td>Each role sees only the actions/data appropriate to its permissions</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SHR-002</td><td>Pay-Per-Feature "Buy Now" purchase flow</td><td>PayPerFeatures &rarr; select a feature &rarr; Buy Now &rarr; complete Razorpay checkout</td><td>Order created &rarr; payment verified (HMAC-SHA256) &rarr; feature added to purchasedFeatures with usageLeft/expiresAt</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SHR-003</td><td>"Upgrade / Buy Again" after usage/expiry exhausted</td><td>Exhaust usageLeft or pass expiresAt on a purchased feature &rarr; revisit PayPerFeatures</td><td>Button shows "Upgrade / Buy Again" instead of "Already Purchased"</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SHR-004</td><td>Payment fails/cancelled mid-checkout</td><td>Close Razorpay modal before completing payment</td><td>Payment record status=failed or cancelled; feature/plan not granted</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SHR-005</td><td>View own Payment History</td><td>Open PaymentHistory (company/jobseeker/college) &rarr; view list</td><td>All own transactions with correct status (completed/failed/refunded/etc.) displayed</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SHR-006</td><td>Submit a review (first time)</td><td>WriteReview &rarr; enter rating + comment &rarr; Submit</td><td>Review created status=pending, awaiting admin approval (see ADM-013)</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SHR-007</td><td>Resubmit/edit an existing review</td><td>Edit a previously submitted (e.g. approved) review &rarr; Save</td><td>Only one review per user retained; status resets to pending for re-approval</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>12.1 Subscription &amp; Payment (Cross-role)</h3>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-001</td><td>Job seeker/recruiter purchase one-time plan</td><td>Subscription page &rarr; choose a paid plan &rarr; create-order &rarr; complete Razorpay &rarr; verify-payment</td><td>Signature verified; plan activated immediately with correct expiry per duration</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-002</td><td>Company/College purchase recurring plan</td><td>Choose a paid plan &rarr; complete Razorpay Subscriptions checkout (auto-renew mandate)</td><td>Recurring subscription created; auto-renew toggle shown as ON</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-003</td><td>Select Free plan</td><td>Choose Free tier plan</td><td>No Razorpay flow triggered; verify-payment called with isFree:true; plan activated instantly</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-004</td><td>Toggle auto-renew off</td><td>Subscription &rarr; disable Auto-Renew</td><td>Mandate stops; plan still valid till current expiry, then lapses to Free</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-005</td><td>Cancel subscription (job seeker)</td><td>Subscription &rarr; Cancel</td><td>Reverts to Free plan; payment record marked cancelled</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-006</td><td>Renewal webhook - successful charge</td><td>Simulate Razorpay subscription.charged webhook</td><td>Subscription expiry extended automatically; user notified (renewal reminder flow N/A here)</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-007</td><td>Renewal webhook - payment halted/pending</td><td>Simulate subscription.halted or .pending webhook</td><td>renewalFailureCount increments; user not yet downgraded</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-008</td><td>Renewal fails 3 times consecutively</td><td>Simulate 3 consecutive failed renewal charges for a College/Company plan</td><td>Auto-downgraded to Free tier after the 3rd failure</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-009</td><td>Tampered payment signature</td><td>Attempt verify-payment with an invalid/tampered signature</td><td>Request rejected, plan not activated, security event logged</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">SUBS-010</td><td>Duplicate/replayed webhook event</td><td>Send the same Razorpay webhook payload twice</td><td>Second event is a no-op (idempotent) - no double renewal/charge applied</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 id="tickets">13. Support Tickets, Messaging &amp; Notifications</h2>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-001</td><td>Raise a ticket with all required fields</td><td>RaiseTicket &rarr; fill userRole, accountIdentity, category (e.g. payment_checkout), severity (e.g. major), check diagnosticsConsent, optionally attach error log &rarr; Submit</td><td>Ticket created status=open; visible in MyTickets and AdminTickets</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-002</td><td>Raise a ticket without diagnostics consent</td><td>Leave diagnosticsConsent unchecked &rarr; Submit</td><td>Submission blocked - consent is required</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-003</td><td>Attach an error log file to a ticket</td><td>Upload a log file &rarr; Submit</td><td>File attached and retrievable by admin on the ticket detail view</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-004</td><td>Track ticket status in MyTickets</td><td>MyTickets &rarr; view own tickets</td><td>Status shown accurately: open/in_progress/resolved/closed</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-005</td><td>Chat with admin while ticket is open</td><td>With an open/in_progress ticket, open Messages &rarr; contact admin</td><td>Chat allowed and functional</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-006</td><td>Attempt to chat with admin without an active ticket</td><td>No open/in_progress ticket exists &rarr; try to message admin</td><td>Blocked - must raise a ticket first</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-007</td><td>Real-time message delivery via Socket.IO</td><td>Two users chat simultaneously in separate sessions</td><td>Messages appear instantly without page refresh on both ends</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-008</td><td>Email notification delivery for key events</td><td>Trigger events (interview invite, application status change, offer, renewal reminder, verification approve/reject, etc.) &rarr; check inbox</td><td>Corresponding email received with correct content</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-009</td><td>WhatsApp template notification delivery</td><td>Trigger an event with a wired WhatsApp template (e.g. interview invite, assessment invite, round status, verification result)</td><td>WhatsApp message received via Meta Cloud API on the registered/normalized phone number</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">TCK-010</td><td>WhatsApp send failure does not block core action</td><td>Simulate WhatsApp API failure during an event (e.g. invalid phone)</td><td>Core action (e.g. status change, invite) still completes; WhatsApp failure is silently caught, not surfaced as an error to the user</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 id="nfr">14. Non-Functional &amp; Cross-Cutting Checks</h2>
<table class="tc">
<tr><th class="col-id">ID</th><th class="col-scn">Scenario</th><th class="col-steps">Steps</th><th class="col-exp">Expected Result</th><th class="col-pri">Pri</th></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-001</td><td>Role-based route guarding</td><td>For each role, attempt to directly navigate (via URL) to every other role's protected routes</td><td>All cross-role access attempts are denied/redirected</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-002</td><td>Session/token expiry handling</td><td>Let auth token expire &rarr; perform any authenticated action</td><td>User redirected to login with a clear session-expired message</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-003</td><td>Responsive layout across breakpoints</td><td>Load key pages (Home, Dashboard, PostJob, Applicants) at 1920px, 1366px, 768px, 390px widths</td><td>Layout adapts correctly, no overlapping/cut-off content, nav collapses to mobile menu</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-004</td><td>Cross-browser compatibility</td><td>Repeat core flows (register, apply to job, post job, pay) on Chrome, Edge, Firefox</td><td>Consistent behavior and layout across browsers</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-005</td><td>Sidebar/Header navigation correctness per role</td><td>Login as each role &rarr; verify Sidebar/Header menu items match that role's permitted pages</td><td>No broken links, no menu items for inaccessible features</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-006</td><td>Confirm-dialog guards for destructive actions</td><td>Trigger delete/cancel actions across modules (delete job, delete drive, cancel subscription, delete user)</td><td>ConfirmDialog appears before the action executes; cancelling the dialog performs no change</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-007</td><td>Feature gate consistency (FeatureGate component)</td><td>Compare locked/unlocked state of a premium feature across Sidebar badge, feature page, and PayPerFeatures page</td><td>Entitlement state is consistent everywhere at once (no stale cached state after purchase)</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-008</td><td>Form field validation messages are clear</td><td>Submit key forms (Register, PostJob, RaiseTicket, WriteReview) with missing/invalid data</td><td>Every required field shows a specific, understandable inline error</td><td class="col-pri p3">P3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-009</td><td>Data consistency after concurrent actions</td><td>Two admins act on the same request/refund/renewal simultaneously</td><td>No duplicate processing; last-write-wins or proper locking behavior, no data corruption</td><td class="col-pri p2">P2</td></tr>
<tr><td class="col-id">NFR-010</td><td>Sensitive data not exposed client-side</td><td>Inspect network responses for password hashes, Razorpay secrets, other users' PII</td><td>No sensitive fields leaked in any API response</td><td class="col-pri p1">P1</td></tr>
</table>

